    """Returns the index of the first position at which the string needle occurs as a contiguous substring of the string haystack, indexed from 0, or -1 if needle is not contained in haystack. See https://pyats.com/string-substring-containment-examples.html for more examples."""
    haystack_length = len(haystack)
